--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. LALANDEOS CORE — APACHE LICENSE 2.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The LalandeOS Core (operating system foundation, hardware abstraction,
native application APIs, system services, IPC, UI foundations, and AI
service interfaces) is planned for release under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. See LICENSE-APACHE-2.0 for the full license text.

Under this license you may freely use, modify, and distribute LalandeOS
Core, including in commercial products, provided you comply with the
Apache License 2.0 terms (including preservation of copyright notices
and the license text).

Note: LalandeOS Core builds do NOT include dynamic application
download, runtime installation, sideloading, or app-store access.
Applications for Core-only builds must be baked into the firmware
image.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. LALANDEOS APPLICATION PLATFORM — COMMERCIAL LICENSE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The LalandeOS Application Platform (WAMR integration, dynamic
application delivery and lifecycle management, app-store connectivity,
signing and certificate validation, certification workflows, and
related managed services) is proprietary software available under the
LalandeOS Commercial License. See LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.

A commercial license is required to ship products that include the
dynamic application platform.
Contact licensing@lalandeos.com for a commercial license.

