5. WHICH LICENSE APPLIES TO WHAT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

If you received LalandeOS Core source code: the Apache License 2.0
applies (LICENSE-APACHE-2.0).

If you received the LalandeOS Application Platform (including any
binary or source distribution of the dynamic application components,
store modules, or signing tools): the LalandeOS Commercial License
applies (LICENSE-COMMERCIAL), in addition to the Apache License 2.0
for the Core components included therein.

In case of conflict between this overview and the actual license
texts, the license texts govern. This overview is informational only
and is not itself a license.

